# Live Edmunds VIN-listing confirmation (2026-09-03, SYS-20260903-005): no
# env vars needed. This server no longer performs its own search-vendor API
# calls — the host AI calling this MCP server does the verification search
# with its own web-search capability and supplies the results via the
# resolve_vehicle_availability tool. See lib/link-resolution.ts's module doc
# and DECISIONS.md SYS-20260903-004/005 for why the earlier
# GOOGLE_CSE_API_KEY/GOOGLE_CSE_CX-based design (a vendor API this server
# would have called directly) was replaced.
